    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ff66077fdbc35e957fa7fc6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她一旦超越极限就难以再坚持下去。菱亚可是能够\n紧咬着白仁不放的选手，要是演变成跟她比耐力……",
      "source_fingerprint": "65428f87c5a62260f46ecb6ce829dee03326d91f86cb0025fab8c0434ecb3d97",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
