      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我要爬得比最强还要更高，到达那道彩虹的另一端。\n而那彩虹另一端就是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a5098e56fa0dd092fdf36a4ebfc090adf67cb52e562cad606dcb83bd37b3b99",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
