      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那场比赛无人不知，是每个赛马娘的憧憬。\n于巴黎西边的塞纳河河畔举办，被誉为世界最美的赛场……",
      "source_fingerprint": "62a643f260e03d65e037f2a835dcf26875978eca6034b9b8bb9d34425355627a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
