      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她真诚地描绘着最棒的梦想，并强烈希望“去实现”、\n“一定要亲手实现”。她只是专注地追随着内心的憧憬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f14975301edaf52da993ffc1178fb6640ae23b5431f0b32412d035e50fa9c5c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
